    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/ca6d32a413639c62684810906d9c73b4.avif?t=1748705913\" width=616 height=224 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, <strong><i>YOU</i></strong>, the player, are busy doing laundry, when SUDDENLY you lose one of your socks\u2026 and get sucked in by an interdimensional portal (as one does). You then arrive in Sockhalla, the land of sentient socks, where you\u2019re immediately greeted by none other than\u2026 <strong>SOCKRATES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/5d31faae069f6f6d0572555ccfa3cbbe.poster.avif?t=1748705913\" width=110 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/5d31faae069f6f6d0572555ccfa3cbbe.webm?t=1748705913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/5d31faae069f6f6d0572555ccfa3cbbe.mp4?t=1748705913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sockrates explains how he accidentally Isekai\u2019d you into this world by drinking too much laundry detergent (yes, for once it wasn\u2019t Truck-kun). As it turns out, Sockrates made a bet with his buddy Aristockle that he could, in fact, open an interdimensional portal, and, well\u2026 here you are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/9fbb5b1b11051ba332a647d2b567c0ba.poster.avif?t=1748705913\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/9fbb5b1b11051ba332a647d2b567c0ba.webm?t=1748705913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/9fbb5b1b11051ba332a647d2b567c0ba.mp4?t=1748705913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is now to explore Sockhalla, talk to all ten seduceable socks, and find your missing sock, your\u2026 SOLEMATE, if you will \u2013 to then go back to Sockrates and reopen the portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you go back to your world with your missing sock? Or will the static you share keep you and your matching pair stuck in Sockhalla? <strong>WISHLIST US, PLAY THE GAME AND FIND OUT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky Visual Novel &amp; RPG Elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/a411501ca3224acfb4ecc01c345d73b1.avif?t=1748705913\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sock Dating Simulator is a visual novel satire with some RPG elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DA MAP</strong></u> \u2013 Explore Sockhalla and unlock new areas of the map, like the Dune section with a t-shirt sandworm (we are dead serious this will be in the final game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DA WAE</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Go on quests to help out NPCs, unlock more areas, get items, or simply to woo and impress the sock of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MY DRESS-UP DARLAINE</strong></u>\u00a0\u2013 Customize your sock and choose stereotypically masculine or feminine characteristics... OR BOTH AT ONCE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FINAL DESTINATIONS</strong></u> \u2013 Choose from a wide range of possible endings (3 endings per character), with the occasional twist here and there depending on if your solemate is a serial killer, a Daddy or a Loli.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>HEAR ME OUT</strong></u> \u2013 Learn how to seduce the sock that leaves you on \u201cread\u201d by choosing between a variety of options and becoming the most rizzful of them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DANK MEMES</u></strong>  \u2013 Interact with a host of very questionable NPCs who love throwing out obscure Internet references that would get us cancelled if investors weren\u2019t all over the age of 45.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CAPITALISM</strong></u> \u2013 Play some (non-boring we promise) mini-games and earn some cold hard CASH to seduce your sockxy socknificant other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DA LORE</strong></u> \u2013 Try this game for the lulz only to find out that the lore is actually surprisingly complex, with the socks having actual religions, celebrities, and most importantly, racism!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SOCKXY ASMR</strong></u> \u2013 Enjoy the FULL VO narration accompanying the text you\u2019ll read and feel extremely uncomfortable by Sock Fatale\u2019s voice and how it makes your blood leave your brain for different areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>THE SOUND OF MUSIC</strong></u> \u2013 Vibe to some quirky nostalgic, Wii and Nintendo-like beats and forget the inevitable end that constantly creeps nearer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>AND FINALLY</strong></u> \u2013 enjoy ALL of the worst sock puns you\u2019ve ever heard all while learning how to talk to someone whose drawers you\u2019d like to slide into!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SO \u2014 are you ready to find your matching pair? Or will you be left hanging? Find out by trying out our demo and seducing Sock Fatale\u2026 <strong>TODAY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/73e7ed4856dd958ab9f4cc50b59f26ea.poster.avif?t=1748705913\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/73e7ed4856dd958ab9f4cc50b59f26ea.webm?t=1748705913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/73e7ed4856dd958ab9f4cc50b59f26ea.mp4?t=1748705913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
