rong></u> \u2013 enjoy ALL of the worst sock puns you\u2019ve ever heard all while learning how to talk to someone whose drawers you\u2019d like to slide into!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SO \u2014 are you ready to find your matching pair? Or will you be left hanging? Find out by trying out our demo and seducing Sock Fatale\u2026 <strong>TODAY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/73e7ed4856dd958ab9f4cc50b59f26ea.poster.avif?t=1748705913\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/73e7ed4856dd958ab9f4cc50b59f26ea.webm?t=1748705913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512190/extras/73e7ed4856dd958ab9f4cc50b59f26ea.mp4?t=1748705913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
